{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fit Sesh 是一款免費的 GPS 運動追蹤工具，適合以步行、跑步或單車作為日常鍛鍊的使用者。它會在戶外活動期間記錄路線與各項體能數據，並把每次訓練整理成可閱讀的摘要。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想了解自身運動表現與進度的人士。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-51.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>實時地圖緊貼運動路線</h2>\n<p>開始記錄後，地圖會實時顯示路線，並列出距離、時間、配速、單車速度、海拔爬升與估計卡路里。即使 iPhone 上鎖或切換應用程式，記錄仍會繼續。完成後可查看運動摘要、瀏覽路線，並產生可分享或列印的 PDF 報告；亦可設定距離、卡路里或時間目標，配合提醒功能檢視長期進度。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-504-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-505-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-506-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-507-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-508-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-52-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fit Sesh</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fit-sesh/id6777316720?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.025450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:37:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:18.653430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:31.241265+00:00","content_hash":"8fb1dcfcc27f0b9411f07a21b50d66733fb01bf2b722957d66c49c51e1ffa5d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.025450+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}